KaTeX 0.16.22

Vendored from the pinned npm dependency. This must match the KaTeX embedded in
Hugo 0.164.0; see docs/architecture.md.

LOCAL MODIFICATION — re-apply after any re-vendor:
  `font-display:swap` is inserted into all 20 @font-face blocks in
  katex.min.css. Upstream ships them with no font-display, which resolves to
  `auto` (block-like in Chromium): on a slow connection rendered math can be
  invisible for up to ~3s on a site whose content is almost entirely math.
  The property is a font-loading hint only — it does not touch the class
  contract that Hugo's build-time KaTeX output depends on.
